{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 85.7, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Run v3 prototype on Hackage/Metacpan Haskell packages: adapt fetch script to scrape package list from hackage.haskell.org/packages, classify using word-boundary need-indicator vocabulary, check for download-count metadata availability, run G1-G4 gates on classified sample. This will progressively narrow the principle's boundary conditions into the Haskell/package-registry domain.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "Built view-count prototype v3 with word-boundary matching, keyword-enhanced classification, and prioritized package ranking. Tested with multiple keywords on PyPI fallback sample. Principle tested across 16 domains, no candidate validated for sustained use. Boundary conditions: works on PyPI (need-related 82.93% vs random 57.50% active rate), NPM, Discourse forums (≥50 per arm). Does not generalize to GitHub issues, web search, Chemistry SE, GitHub code repos, etc. V3 improvements: reduces substring false positives (e.g., 'database' inside 'databaseify'), checks project name for need indicators, graceful API failure fallback, prioritizes active packages with most need indicators. Next: fresh observation in new domain per D083 - recommended Hackage/Metacpan (Haskell) or other non-software domain with exposable metadata.", "unlogged_changes": 25}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 27, "session": "2026-10-14-012-initiate-fresh-view-count-experiment-on", "ts": "2026-10-14T09:59:19+00:00"}
